## 5. Folded-In Polish (M4-Deferred)

### [CXC-BE-POLISH] Sweep Up the Composer Debt

- items: widget-catalog **thumbnails** (cheap — headless-render each catalog widget type small, cache); **undo/redo** (port the CTk `history.py` command-stack pattern — the command protocol already carries do/undo); **zoom/pan** on the WW; a **resizable splitter** for the 2/3–1/3 divide; **catalog search**.
- rationale: these are all "the WC/WW becomes a real editor" work, so they land naturally with the binding editor rather than as a separate pass.
- status: partial (2026-07-07) — LANDED: **undo/redo** (core-level inverse-step stacks over the SAME dispatcher: every canvas/config/namespace/source-replace command is invertible incl. raw-property + z-index restore; `composer/history/undo|redo` bus events, MQTT-imported; Cmd/Ctrl+Z, Cmd+Shift+Z/Ctrl+Y, topbar buttons) and **catalog search** (LiveInput filter over name/type/description). DEFERRED to a later slug: thumbnails, zoom/pan, resizable splitter (all cosmetic; the Lottie slug takes priority).
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-BINDEDIT]

